    "title": "Tiptoe Through (But Not On) the Tulips - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michael Donahue ,\n1 days ago I wanted to see what 650,000 tulips look like. So, I visited Dixon Gallery and Gardens last week to check out this phenomenon. It’s fantastic. This is something you must see. Colorful tulips everywhere. And I mean everywhere. Masses of them. They were planted to celebrate Dixon’s 50th anniversary. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
